      "side": 1,
      "message": "For speed\u003e\u003d3, enable_winner_mode_for_tx_size_srch sf is enabled (i.e., winner mode logic for transform size search). \n1) During normal mode evaluation stage, only largest transform size possible is evaluated (no transform split). Hence there is not impact of this sf in this stage. \n2) During winner mode evaluation stage, transform split is evaluated for winner mode. As there is only one winner mode candidate, the sf does not prune any evaluations in this stage.\n \nThus, the sf should not have any impact for speed\u003e\u003d3.",
